## 1 Introduction and 2 Test items

Purpose: detect functional, security and integration defects before demonstrations and provide evidence linked to requirements. Scope: browser UI, API services, relational database, matching algorithm, CI and deployment. Test items are the versioned backend/frontend, migrations, fixtures, Docker images and deployment configuration. Record the Git commit for each run.


