## 14 Metrics and reporting

Execution rate = executed / planned in-scope cases; pass rate = passed / executed; requirement acceptance = requirements with all relevant cases passed / in-scope requirements. Report failed and blocked separately; never include Not run as passed. Report open defects by severity and age, backend/Auth coverage, search p90 and matching p95. Burndown tracks estimated completed stories, not test case count or hours elapsed.

Defect report fields: title, linked requirement/case/Jira key, environment/commit, reproduction steps, expected/actual, severity, owner and evidence. Critical: data loss, account takeover or double reservation; High: core flow unavailable or privacy/authorization failure; Medium: partial flow defect with workaround; Low: cosmetic defect. Retest fixes and regress nearby functions.


